---
import BlogArticleShell from '../../../components/BlogArticleShell.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const canonicalPath = '/blog/annual-reps-shopping-calendar-2026';
const publishedISO = '2026-05-20';
---

<BlogArticleShell
  title="The 2026 Reps Calendar: Best Months to Buy via Spreadsheets | kakobuy-cn.com"
  description="A month-by-month guide to the Chinese reps market. When to buy winter gear, when to avoid the CNY backlog, and how to time the major sales."
  canonicalPath={canonicalPath}
  headline="The 2026 Reps Calendar: Timing Your Hauls for Maximum Savings"
  publishedISO={publishedISO}
  displayDate="20 May 2026"
  structuredKeywords={[
    'reps shopping calendar 2026',
    'best time to buy reps',
    'Chinese New Year shipping 2026',
    '618 sale reps',
    '11.11 shopping agent guide',
  ]}
>
  <p class="blog-lede" slot="lede">
    The Chinese marketplace operates on a specific seasonal rhythm. For a <strong><a href="/">Kakobuy Spreadsheet</a></strong> user, knowing <em>when</em> to buy is just as important as knowing <em>what</em> to buy. This is your 12-month roadmap for 2026.
  </p>

  <h2>Q1: The CNY Survival Period</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>January - February:</strong> This is the most dangerous time for link rot. Factories close for Chinese New Year, and stock levels in spreadsheets become unreliable. 
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Strategy:</strong> Buy before Jan 15th or wait until late February. See our <a href="/blog/china-public-holidays-agent-forwarding-2026/">2026 Holiday Guide</a> for specific dates.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Q2: The Spring Refresh & 618 Sale</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>March - June:</strong> The "Golden Era" for discovery. New batches of summer gear (tees, shorts, slides) hit the spreadsheets.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Highlight:</strong> The <strong>618 Sale</strong> in June is the best time for mid-year discounts. Check our <a href="/blog/taobao-tmall-618-2026-spreadsheet-forwarding-rhythm/">618 strategy guide</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Q3: Pre-Winter Sourcing</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>July - September:</strong> Smart buyers start looking for puffers and heavy knits now. Prices are lower, and <a href="/blog/winter-puffer-jacket-shipping-volumetric-hacks/">volumetric shipping lines</a> are less congested.
  </p>

  <h2>Q4: The "Mega-Haul" Season</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>October - December:</strong> Double 11 (11.11) and 12.12 are the biggest sales of the year. Expect <strong>logistics delays</strong> but massive spreadsheet updates.
  </p>
  <div class="blog-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Month</th>
          <th>Focus Category</th>
          <th>Shipping Risk</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>June</td>
          <td>Tees & Slides</td>
          <td>Low</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>September</td>
          <td>Jackets & Hoodies</td>
          <td>Moderate</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>November</td>
          <td>Everything (Sales)</td>
          <td>High (Backlogs)</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    <strong>Summary:</strong> Plan your hauls 3 months in advance of the season you're shopping for. Your wallet (and your agent) will thank you.
  </p>
</BlogArticleShell>
